            "title": "Avago: Avadon 2 – The Corruption Is Out, Plus Demo",
            "date": "2013-11-01 06:00:11",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/rps/1045127258793071271",
            "content": "<p><img src=\"http://www.rockpapershotgun.com/images/13/oct/avad.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p>Spiderweb&#8217;s Jeff Vogel has been making RPGs for twenty years, but I only caught onto them a couple of years back. But my tardiness doesn&#8217;t dampen my enthusiasm to learn his new game is now out. <a href=\"http://www.spidweb.com/avadon2/index.html\">Avadon 2: The Corruption</a>, the sequel to 2011&#8242;s Avadon: The Black Fortress, is out today. And it promises lots of improvements over the last, already very decent game, based on player feedback.</p>\n<p> <a href=\"http://www.rockpapershotgun.com/2013/11/01/avago-avadon-2-the-corruption-is-out-plus-demo/#more-174726\" class=\"more-link\">(more&#8230;)</a></p>\n"
